	Display Name=Fireball
	Description=A ball of fire hits the targeted area causing fire damage to all enemies within a radius of %i[ShowRadius] feet. Enemies at the center of the area of effect take %i[damage] fire damage, while enemies that are further away take less damage based on the distance from the target. A targeted enemy also takes an additional %i[DelayedMinDamage]-%i[DelayedMaxDamage] fire damage 2 seconds after the initial explosion.%?[HideKnockdown] At higher levels, there is a chance the targeted enemy will be knocked down.%?[HideKnockdown]%?[ShowKnockdown] There is a %i[KnockdownChance]% chance that the targeted enemy will be knocked down.%?[ShowKnockdown]
